4.2 Nature of INTRA code-switching in Irish tweets
One striking outcome of preliminary observations of this work is the distribution of syntactic patterns that arise within intra-sentential code-switching between Irish and English. There is a clear ease with which English nouns are used to replace Irish nouns in a single instance. For example Figiu´ir´ı nua tally do Chonamara ‘New tally ﬁg-

